{"title":"2024 Christmas Event","slug":"2024_Christmas_Event","hero":null,"pageid":3646,"revid":16687,"timestamp":"2024-12-26T06:22:52Z","lastEditor":"Jared1842","categories":["Stubs"],"infobox":null,"sections":[{"id":"overview","text":"Overview"}],"body":"<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><p><span>This page is a <span data-unresolved=\"1\">stub</span>!</span><br>\n<span>You can help the Oaklands Wiki by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/2024_Christmas_Event?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.</span></p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"overview\">Overview</h2>\n<p>The <b>2024 Christmas Event</b> (aka <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Version_1.71.0/\">Version 1.71.0</a>) was released on December 1st, 2024. With this update came many new changes, including <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Santa's_Workshop/\">Santa's Workshop</a>, <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Auroracrest_Axe/\">Auroracrest Axe</a> and <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Auroracrest_Pickaxe/\">Pickaxe</a>, the comeback of <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Snowball/\">Snowballs</a> and <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Stocking/\">Stockings</a>, and a whole different look at the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Snowy_Peaks/\">Snowlands</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<caption>Categorized Additions\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Added\n</th>\n<th>Location\n</th>\n<th>Category\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Santa's_Workshop/\">Santa's Workshop</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Flowering_Meadows/\">Flowering Meadows</a>\n</td>\n<td>Shop\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Gizmo's_Observatory/\">Gizmo's Observatory</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Snowy_Peaks/\">Snowlands</a>\n</td>\n<td>Shop\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>???\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Snowy_Peaks/\">Snowlands</a>\n</td>\n<td>Shop\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Snowdrift_Station_A_&_B/\">Snowdrift Stations A &amp; B</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\